# a scope's own name, super from its def's name
src/analyze_cls.c cf_kdyn_method a scope's own name
src/analyze_cls.c cf_node a scope's own name
src/analyze_infer.c infer_uncached a scope's own shadow name
src/analyze_infer.c super_reaches_exc_text super, by its def's name

# a Symbol argument's method (method(:m), a send's), not the name a call is
# written with: no call is versioned by it
src/analyze_util.c class_value_bind_call_gap a Symbol argument's method
src/analyze_util.c class_value_bind_call_target a Symbol argument's method
src/analyze_util.c method_obj_target_mi_raw a Method object's method
